This PR improves the interface granularity. All information provided by the SERVER_INFO command can now also be queried with individual. This is useful for clients with screens that only display partial information and/or use asynchronous request processing, e.g. apps or JavaScript.
The methods in rasctl.cpp that are dealing with sending commands and displaying results were moved to separate classes.

@rdmark Note that PbServerInfo has changed. All data which were not yet available as separate messages have been extracted to individual messages. The data structures as such have not changed. Please see the .proto file for details. The RESERVE command was renamed to RESERVE_IDS. For consistency reasons PbDevices was renamed to PbDevicesInfo.

